OL,3,GNEWSANHS Tayside apology to patients
OL,4,Aafter scientist's data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Tayside has apologised to almost
OL,7,F400 patients whose records were
OL,8,Faccessed by a Ninewells Hospital
OL,9,Fscientist who was subsequently fired
OL,10,Ffor gross misconduct.
OL,12,FDr Glen Gardner was dismissed in June
OL,13,Flast year after accessing patient
OL,14,Frecords 497 times while assigned to
OL,15,Fnon-clinical duties.
OL,17,FThe breach came to light after Gardner,
OL,18,Fwho claimed he had a legitimate reason
OL,19,Ffor accessing the records, had his
OL,20,Fclaim for unfair dismissal refused.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
